Emoji pictures used by Parental Control (Eduka-Settings and the message
screen), so they look right on every computer, also without a color emoji font.

Source: Noto Emoji by Google, https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji
(2D/png/128). Tools and image resources of Noto Emoji are licensed under the
